Goal:
Build analytics for marketing, conversion, revenue, and engagement.

Track public events:
- page_view
- pricing_view
- checkout_start
- checkout_submit
- payment_pending
- student_form_submit
- level_check_start
- level_check_submit
- booking_request
- article_open
- video_play
- testimonial_submit

Track learning events:
- login
- homework_submit
- scenario_submit
- review_submit
- flashcard_review
- session_completed
- badge_earned

Owner analytics pages:
- /owner/analytics
- /owner/analytics/marketing
- /owner/analytics/students
- /owner/analytics/revenue
- /owner/analytics/content

Metrics:
- Visitors
- Conversion funnel
- Checkout conversion
- Payment status breakdown
- Revenue by plan
- Active students
- Lesson completion
- Homework submission rate
- Student engagement
- Low activity students
- Article/video performance
