Privacy:
- Do not expose private data publicly.
- Avoid tracking sensitive unnecessary data.

Acceptance criteria:
- Events are recorded.
- Owner sees analytics dashboard.
- Funnel is visible.
- Student engagement metrics show useful data.

Manual test checklist:
- Visit public pages.
- Start checkout.
- Submit level check.
- Submit homework.
- Check analytics dashboard.

